2	 * Test Suite for Receipt Image Resizing
3	 *
4	 * Tests for:
5	 * - #{#rsz1a} - Resize images before Mistral OCR (max 2000px, 85% quality)
6	 * - #{#rsz1b} - Client-side image resizing implementation
7	 *
8	 * Authority: system (rsz1a), developer (rsz1b)
9	 * Priority: High
